WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:05.160
Kylo Ren the Star Wars sequels' resident bad
boy and dark side-abider played by Adam Driver

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.420
has walked a dangerous path in The Force Awakens
and The Last Jedi, and will continue taking

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:13.480
what he believes is rightfully his by whatever
means necessary in the upcoming film The Rise

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.280
of Skywalker.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:19.300
But Kylo will need more than his angsty attitude,
hilted lightsaber, inexplicably high-waisted

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.050
pants, and the burning desire to emulate his
late grandfather Darth Vader to get where

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:23.780
he wants to go.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.300
He'll need a ship a big one, a stealth one.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.170
Thanks to a photo of a yet-to-be-released
The Rise of Skywalker toy obtained by Twitter

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:34.370
user @_selenejade, we now know what model
of ship Kylo Ren will pilot in The Rise of

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:38.160
Skywalker and the name seems to offer some
pretty juicy hints about what the baddie might

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.320
get up to in the film.

00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:42.760
Here's your one and only warning, friends:
turn back now if you don't want to learn any

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.420
spoilers for The Rise of Skywalker.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.260
We can't exactly Jedi mind trick them out
of your memory.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:51.350
As seen on the packaging for the new Kylo
Ren Funko Pop figure, scheduled to hit shelves

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:54.800
on Triple Force Friday on October 4th, the
villain will get behind the helm of a TIE

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.580
Whisper in The Rise of Skywalker.

00:00:56.710 --> 00:01:00.660
The TIE Whisper looks to be a riff on the
TIE Fighter and TIE Interceptor ships, both

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:01.900
favorites of the Galactic Empire.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:06.020
It features a spherical black hull accented
with the same shade of red that Kylo Ren's

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.660
lightsaber glows, and four foreboding, round
wings.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:12.980
What's important to note about this new information
isn't so much the model name itself but what

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:17.150
"TIE Whisper" suggests about Kylo Ren's behavior
and motives in The Rise of Skywalker.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:21.310
Specifically, "Whisper" implies that Kylo
may take a new approach to battle in the upcoming

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:21.800
film.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:25.980
In The Force Awakens and The Last Jedi, Kylo
had no problem killing, resorting to violence,

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:29.820
and being about as bold and brash as any larger-than-life
villain can be.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:33.869
That may all be because that's just who Kylo
has become since abandoning his family, the

00:01:33.869 --> 00:01:37.560
light side of the Force, and his birth name
Ben Solo to align with the First Order, or

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:41.020
it might be because he's actively trying to
do what he believes his grandfather would

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:43.649
have done in order to gain some semblance
of importance.

00:01:43.649 --> 00:01:47.560
In any case, Kylo has been unapologetically
bombastic over the course of the last two

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.980
Star Wars movies, and that's cost him a few
things.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.860
Kylo lost his father at his own hand and a
good chunk of his face in a fight, broke his

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.950
beloved helmet, had his confidence knocked
down a few pegs in lightsaber duels with Rey,

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:02.450
and was finally put in his place in a jaw-dropping
battle against Luke Skywalker, who, it turns

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.980
out, had been Force-projecting in order to
help the Resistance escape from the First

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:06.480
Order.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:10.740
Despite Kylo's best efforts, and in the face
of great adversity, the Resistance is growing

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:12.820
stronger even with diminishing numbers.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.620
Kylo may very well realize in The Rise of
Skywalker that he must be stealthy and go

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:20.500
undetected if he hopes to achieve his ultimate
goal of total galaxy domination.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.170
But what exactly will Kylo Ren do in The Rise
of Skywalker, and why does he need a new ship

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:24.900
to get it done?

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:29.100
Isn't his personal TIE Silencer, a nod to
Darth Vader's own TIE advanced ship, enough?

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.560
"Clear your mind of questions.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.120
Mmmm…

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.340
Mmmm..."

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:43.140
Well, according to the description of a new
Kylo Mattel Black Series figure, he will continue

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:46.760
to, quote, "search for secrets of the Force
from the depths of the dark side" in The Rise

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:47.560
of Skywalker.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:51.340
Given that his tactics have been hit-or-miss
in the past, it stands to reason that Kylo

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:55.390
would want to ensure success by being a little
more sly this time around which is something

00:02:55.390 --> 00:03:00.340
that his fancy shmancy, souped-up TIE Silencer
can't exactly do what with all the, y'know…

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.340
laser cannons and missile launchers and whatnot.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:06.380
Whether he'll be successful with a more stealthy
approach is another question, though recent

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:10.170
rumors claim that Kylo will ultimately be
completely crushed by the second act of The

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.220
Rise of Skywalker.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:15.560
Allegedly, the struggles Kylo faces in the
new movie will lead his late father Han Solo

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:19.820
to appear to him in a vision, delivering him
a rousing message that spurs him to abandon

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.760
his Kylo Ren persona and turn to the light
side of the Force.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:26.820
If that actually ends up happening, we hope
Kylo er, Ben Solo at least gets to keep his

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.440
cool new ship.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.720
The Rise of Skywalker flies into theaters
on December 20th.

